    "Lenning reached the sand dunes near Cap Gris-Nez on his English Channel swim in 2010. The following summer he crossed the North Channel from Northern Ireland to Scotland. Brian Meharg piloted Blue Aquarius on that 14-hour-44-minute-50-second crossing.",
